  "title": "Homemade Chex Party Mix",
  "description": "This classic Chex mix recipe rich with butter, mixed nuts, pretzels, and Chex cereal is baked low and slow to make a savory holiday snack favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "Wick of Twizt"
  ],
